title: IainSchweblin1
---
Iain was used to the silence of The Great Plains, but this place was different. There was an unnatural stillness that crept deep within him. He could hear the sound of his heart beating in his chest and his blood as it ran cold. 
->Let him stir in the silence
    The sound of his heart beating reminds him he's alive and in control.
->Create a dull sound from far off in the distance
    <<reduce_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    He looks around him only to find nothing. The sound was innocuous enough. He's glad to know the world is still turning. 
->Fill his head with the sounds of people talking all around him
    <<add_fear "Iain Schweblin">>
    <<discover_fear "Iain Schweblin" 1>>
    <<terrified "Iain Schweblin">>
    //Fear of crowds
    Iain grabs his head. This isolation is starting to get to him, corrupting his mind. The voices slowly dissipate, but a the feeling that he could be losing it lingers. 
->Create a sharp ringing noise
    Iain grabs his head. "Where the hell is that coming from?" He walks further down the hall to investigate. 
